にも女性にも見える雰囲気で\n・キャラ表情絵差分\n(スーツ時1枚(デフォルト)、\n室内時(デフォルト顔、目閉じ笑顔、不機嫌顔、狂気顔+おまかせ))で合わせて5~6枚程度、癖にぶっ刺さりそうな表情だと尚良しでお願いします。\n※イラストについて不明点などがございましたら、解釈におまかせしていただいて問題ございません。\n\n納品形式について、\n人物と背景を分けてpsdで納品を希望しております。\n\n金額不足や内容不備がございましたらお手数ですが再送していただけると幸いです。\n何卒よろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1158780, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "えのまる", "screen_name": "number_TRPG", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1930094699949502464/Wq640aHi.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1264327466870386688/1735916951/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "novel"}], "nc": 129}, {"id": 3499547, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "500×500px製作所", "screen_name": "500_500px", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1921339004236267520/2mwODdvW.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1881302822735790080/1746917930/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 48}, {"id": 3591619, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "まっしろけ", "screen_name": "otukisama_siro", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1970548805708980224/nGRRA_SH.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1896242104088854529/1758787322/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "de